      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Dehaka is great on large Maps where his global presence can be abused to its maximum. This allows Dehaka to soak lanes away from an Objective longer than other Offlaners, and still show up on time to help his team secure kills.\n\nDehaka does not have a Mount, so he relies on Brushstalker to move across the battlefield on Maps. Due to this limitation, he struggles on Maps that lack bushes between lanes and around important areas."
